# Google Analytics 4 (GA4) - free, used by the /api/v1/analytics module.
# GA4_PROPERTY_ID: the numeric Property ID from GA4 Admin > Property Settings.
# GA4_CLIENT_EMAIL / GA4_PRIVATE_KEY: a service account (Google Cloud
# Console > IAM & Admin > Service Accounts) with "Viewer" access granted
# on the GA4 property (GA4 Admin > Property Access Management). Paste the
# private_key from the downloaded JSON key exactly as-is, including the
# \n sequences and BEGIN/END lines, wrapped in quotes.
GA4_PROPERTY_ID=
GA4_CLIENT_EMAIL=
GA4_PRIVATE_KEY=

